OL,3,GNEWSACricketers mistaken for migrants
OL,4,Ahad 'doors knocked on'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of Pakistan's under-19 cricket
OL,7,Fteam had people "knocking on their
OL,8,Fdoors" after a crowd of protesters
OL,9,Fgathered outside their Portsmouth
OL,10,Fhotel, wrongly believing they were
OL,11,Fmigrants.
OL,13,FAbout 30 to 40 people congregated at
OL,14,Fthe Marriot Hotel in Cosham on Tuesday
OL,15,Fevening after false rumours circulated
OL,16,Fthat a coach carrying migrants had
OL,17,Farrived.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
